export const soundSpellingLessons: readonly SoundSpellingLesson[] = [governmentSoundSpelling,...coreBatch1,...expandedA,...expandedB,...expandedC,...highschoolUnit1,...highschoolUnit2Initial,...highschoolUnit2Next,...highschoolUnit2Travel,...highschoolUnit2Culture,...highschoolUnit2Economy,...highschoolUnit2Check,...highschoolUnit2History,...highschoolUnit2Places,...highschoolUnit3Initial,...highschoolUnit3Sports,...highschoolUnit3Track,...highschoolUnit3Glory,...highschoolUnit3Health,...highschoolUnit3Effort,...highschoolUnit3Usage,...highschoolUnit3Healthy,...highschoolUnit3Finish,...highschoolUnit4Weather,...highschoolUnit4Rescue,...highschoolUnit4Shelter,...highschoolUnit4Ruins,...highschoolUnit4Recover,...highschoolUnit4Revival,...highschoolUnit4Supplies,...highschoolUnit4Emergency,...highschoolUnit4Strike,...highschoolUnit4Places,...highschoolUnit5Initial,...highschoolUnit5System,...highschoolUnit5History,...highschoolUnit5Variety,...highschoolUnit5Global,...highschoolUnit5Era,...highschoolUnit5Semester,...highschoolUnit5Demand,...highschoolUnit5Languages,...highschoolBook2Unit1Heritage,...highschoolBook2Unit1Application,...highschoolBook2Unit1Proposal,...highschoolBook2Unit1Prevent,...highschoolBook2Unit1Contribute,...highschoolBook2Unit1Issue,...highschoolBook2Unit1Worthwhile,...highschoolWelcomeExchange,...highschoolWelcomeFormal,...highschoolWelcomeImpress,...highschoolWelcomeForwards,...highschoolBook2Unit1Overseas,...highschoolBook2Unit1Image,...highschoolBook2Unit1Places,...highschoolBook2Unit2Poster,...highschoolBook2Unit2Rate,...highschoolBook2Unit2Concern,...highschoolBook2Unit2Reserve,...highschoolBook2Unit2Sacred,...highschoolBook2Unit2Threaten,...highschoolBook2Unit2Dolphin,...highschoolBook2Unit3Blogger,...highschoolBook2Unit3Surf,...highschoolBook2Unit3Battery,...highschoolBook2Unit3Troll,...highschoolBook2Unit4Web,...highschoolBook2Unit4Kingdom,...highschoolBook2Unit4Defence,...highschoolBook2Unit4Charge,...highschoolBook2Unit4Roll,...highschoolBook2Unit4Names,...highschoolBook2Unit5Music,...highschoolBook2Unit5Opportunity,...highschoolBook2Unit5Original,...highschoolBook2Unit5Previous,...highschoolBook2Unit5Assume,...highschoolBook2Unit5Moreover,...highschoolBook2Unit5Names,...highschoolBook3Unit1Carnival,...highschoolBook3Unit1Range,...highschoolBook3Unit1Harvest,...highschoolBook3Unit1Fade,...highschoolBook3Unit1Reflect,...highschoolBook3Unit1Eve,...highschoolBook3Unit1Frank,...highschoolBook3Unit1Wrestle,...highschoolBook3Unit1Grace,...highschoolBook3Unit1Names,...highschoolBook3Unit2Moral,...highschoolBook3Unit2Tuition,...highschoolBook3Unit2Physician,...highschoolBook3Unit2Elect,...highschoolBook3Unit2Retire,...highschoolBook3Unit2Replace,...highschoolBook3Unit2Memory,...highschoolBook3Unit2Cafe,...highschoolBook3Unit2Despair,...highschoolBook3Unit2Institutions,...highschoolBook3Unit3Diverse,...highschoolBook3Unit3Downtown,...highschoolBook3Unit3Fortune,...highschoolBook3Unit3Series,...highschoolBook3Unit3Mushroom,...highschoolBook3Unit3Settle,...highschoolBook3Unit3Places,...highschoolBook3Unit4Procedure,...highschoolBook3Unit4Launch,...highschoolBook3Unit4Transmit,...highschoolBook3Unit4Dock,...highschoolBook3Unit4Solar,...highschoolBook3Unit4Facility,...highschoolBook3Unit4Analysis,...highschoolBook3Unit4Resource,...highschoolBook3Unit4SpaceNames,...highschoolBook3Unit5Basis,...highschoolBook3Unit5Narrator,...highschoolBook3Unit5Indicate,...highschoolBook3Unit5Pursue,...highschoolBook3Unit5Indeed,...highschoolOptional1Unit1Physiology,...highschoolOptional1Unit1Academic,...highschoolOptional1Unit1Apparently,...highschoolOptional1Unit1Theory,...highschoolOptional1Unit1Consequence,...highschoolOptional1Unit2Start,...highschoolOptional1Unit2Smart,...highschoolOptional1Unit2Detect];
const lessonsByWord=new Map(soundSpellingLessons.map(lesson=>[lesson.headword.toLowerCase(),lesson]));

export function getSoundSpellingLessons(headword:string):SoundSpellingLesson[] {
 return [...new Set(mainHeadwords(headword).flatMap(word=>{
  const lesson=lessonsByWord.get(word.trim().toLowerCase());
  return lesson?[lesson]:[];
 }))];
}

export function getSoundSpellingLesson(headword:string):SoundSpellingLesson|undefined {
 return getSoundSpellingLessons(headword)[0];
}
